evisions included\"}],\" — more included rounds generally means a higher base price\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"A Realistic Pricing Framework\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Rather than quoting flat numbers that go stale fast, here's how to think about where a project lands:\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"div\",\"table-31\",{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto my-8 border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-left border-collapse font-mono text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] font-bold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Complexity Tier\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"What It Includes\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Turnaround\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Simple\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Single subject, minimal/flat background, standard color\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"3–7 days\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Standard\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Full scene, one main subject, moderate detail and rendering\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"1–2 weeks\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Complex\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Multiple subjects, detailed background, full rendering/lighting\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"2–3 weeks\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Rush (any tier)\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Same scope, compressed timeline\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"24–72 hours, rush fee applies\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Manga and comic covers tend to sit at the standard-to-complex end by default, since character accuracy and composition work is usually non-negotiable for that format.\"]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"What's Usually Included vs. What Costs Extra\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Most structured commission processes include a set number of revision rounds and a standard license (personal or limited promotional use) in the base price. Where extra cost typically comes in:\"]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Commercial/full distribution licensing beyond the base agreement\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Revisions beyond the included rounds\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Rush delivery\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"li\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Print-specific file prep (bleed, CMYK conversion, physical dimensions)\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Asking about these upfront — before you're mid-project — avoids surprise costs later.\"]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Why the Cheapest Option Isn't Always the Best Value\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"p\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A very low price usually means one of a few things: a simpler process with fewer revision rounds, a less experienced artist still building a portfolio, or unclear licensing that could cause problems later if the release does well. None of those are automatically dealbreakers — but they're worth knowing about upfront, not discovering after the fact.\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"p\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The better question isn't \\\"what's the cheapest option\\\" but \\\"what does this price actually include\\\" — revisions, rights, and turnaround all belong in that comparison, not just the number itself.\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n27:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Getting an Accurate Quote\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"p\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The fastest way to get a real number instead of a guess is to send a specific brief: subject count, reference images, intended use, and desired turnaround. A structured commission process — like the one used for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration commissions here\"}],\" — will typically return a quote based on that brief rather than a generic price list, which is the only way to get a number that actually reflects your project.\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Cover art pricing looks confusing from the outside because it's genuinely tied to project scope, not a fixed menu. Once you know the actual levers — subject count, detail level, rights, and turnaround — you can budget accurately and have a much more useful conversation with whoever you end up commissioning.\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-brand font-anton text-[28px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"JHAY SANYAY\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-sub font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Visual Artist & Illustrator · Nigeria\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-links flex gap-[20px] font-mono text-[12px] mt-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/portfolio\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Portfolio\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Guides & Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://linktr.ee/jhaysanyay\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Linktree ↗\"}]